title "SAP S/4HANA (Run)"
layout tiers
subtitle "On Premise Systems – Multiple Locations, Production only"

# not modelled: legend, domain colour key, "Updated" date, two "depends on your
# reporting needs / combine or separate offerings by location?" notes, callout note
# (infrastructure TMS/TMSO not depicted on this slide)
# Stacked boxes on the slide (front card + back card) are modelled as separate
# entities; only the front cards carry drawn connectors, back-card edges mirror them.
# Slide inconsistency: the SAP Transportation Mgmt Prod stack reads "EMEA" on both
# cards, and the SAP Transport BSO front card has no location (back card "EMEA");
# the unlabelled variants are assumed to be US, mirroring the SAP Finance stacks.

BA erp: SAP S/4HANA ERP
BA finance: SAP Finance Mgmt
BA tm: SAP Transportation Mgmt

SI erp-prod-emea: SAP S/4HANA ERP Prod EMEA
SI transport-prod-us: S/4HANA Trans Mgmt Prod US
SI finance-prod-us: SAP Finance Prod US
SI finance-prod-emea: SAP Finance Prod EMEA
SI tm-prod-emea: SAP Transportation Mgmt Prod EMEA
SI tm-prod-us: SAP Transportation Mgmt Prod US

BSO finance-reporting-us: SAP Finance Group Reporting US
BSO finance-reporting-emea: SAP Finance Group Reporting EMEA
BSO transport-us: SAP Transport US
BSO transport-emea: SAP Transport EMEA
BS accounting: Accounting Services
BS fleet: Fleet and Logistics Mgmt Services

CI(Application) fiori-emea: Front End SAP Fiori Apps Odata Services
CI(Application) backend-emea: Backend Apps ABAP
CI(Application) hana-emea: HANA Database
CI(Infrastructure) infra-emea: Infrastructure CIs (Servers / Network Gear / Storage)
CI(Application) fiori-us: Front End SAP Fiori Apps Odata Services
CI(Application) backend-us: Backend Apps ABAP
CI(Application) hana-us: HANA Database
CI(Infrastructure) infra-us: Infrastructure CIs (Servers / Network Gear / Storage)

TMSO sap-admin-emea: SAP Administration EMEA
TMSO sap-admin-us: SAP Administration US
TMS app-mgmt: App Mgmt Services

# platform host
finance -> erp
tm -> erp
erp -> erp-prod-emea
erp -> transport-prod-us
finance -> finance-prod-us
finance -> finance-prod-emea
tm -> tm-prod-emea
tm -> tm-prod-us

finance-prod-us -> erp-prod-emea
finance-prod-emea -> erp-prod-emea
tm-prod-emea -> transport-prod-us
tm-prod-us -> transport-prod-us

finance-reporting-us -> finance-prod-us
finance-reporting-emea -> finance-prod-emea
transport-us -> tm-prod-us
transport-emea -> tm-prod-emea
finance-reporting-us -> accounting
finance-reporting-emea -> accounting
transport-us -> fleet
transport-emea -> fleet

# each stack is drawn as one blue connector from the instance to the
# Infrastructure CIs box, running behind Fiori / Backend / HANA; read as a chain
erp-prod-emea -> fiori-emea
fiori-emea -> backend-emea
backend-emea -> hana-emea
hana-emea -> infra-emea
transport-prod-us -> fiori-us
fiori-us -> backend-us
backend-us -> hana-us
hana-us -> infra-us

sap-admin-emea -> erp-prod-emea
sap-admin-us -> transport-prod-us
sap-admin-emea -> app-mgmt
sap-admin-us -> app-mgmt
